SUMMARY:Pancake Breakfast with Santa and Christmas Raffle in Berlin
LOCATION:Berlin Community Center\, 3309 U.S. Highway 278\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Grab a plate of pancakes with bacon or sausage and a drink\, vi
 sit with Santa and try your luck in the Christmas raffle. Prizes include a
  go kart\, a mini bike\, a kids ride on mower and a 36 inch Blackstone gri
 ddle\, with the drawing right after breakfast. Every raffle dollar goes to
  the fire department's Christmas for Kids program. Time: 7:00 AM to 10:00 
 AM Host: Berlin Volunteer Fire Department and Town of Berlin Cost: Plates 
 by donation\; raffle tickets $5 each or six for $20
